}
]]></ProtectedString></Properties></Item><Item class="ModuleScript" referent="RBX000016"><Properties><string name="Name">NpcLooks</string><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--!nonstrict
-- Colors and procedural accessories for NPCs. Optional catalog accessory ids can be added
-- to `catalogHats` (numbers); they are applied through HumanoidDescription.
